OL,3,ANigerian dances non-stop for seven days
OL,4,Ain world record bid
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Nigerian dancer has completed a
OL,7,F168-hour dance marathon in Lagos in a
OL,8,Fbid to set a new world record.
OL,10,FBenjamin Daniel, known as "Ben Dancer",
OL,11,Faimed to dance for seven days to break
OL,12,Fthe Guinness World Records title for
OL,13,Fthe longest dance marathon by an
OL,14,Findividual.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
