OL,3,ANigerian dances non-stop for seven days
OL,4,Ain world record bid
OL,5,
OL,6,FCheered on by friends and supporters at
OL,7,FLagos's Freedom Park, the 33-year-old
OL,8,Freached his target time at around 03:00
OL,9,Flocal time but continued dancing for
OL,10,Fanother nine hours until midday, his
OL,11,Fteam says. The physically exhausted
OL,12,Fdancer has now gone to hospital for a
OL,13,Fmedical check-up.
OL,15,FGuinness World Records has confirmed to
OL,16,Fthe BBC that it has received Daniel's
OL,17,Fapplication for the title. The current
OL,18,Frecord stands at 127 hours.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
